{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461380/extras/steam2.gif?t=1745472676\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a meteor struck the moon, Seoul fell into silence. The city lost its light and color, and daily life came to a quiet halt\u2014like scattered fragments left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Luna, a timid rabbit hiding away in a rooftop room, discovers a fallen moon fragment in her yard. With that small spark of courage, she steps outside for the first time and begins a journey to restore the city\u2019s missing colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Luna Hop is a 3D narrative adventure set in a reimagined modern Seoul.</strong><br>As Luna, you\u2019ll collect moon fragments, bring color back to faded spaces, and explore a city that feels both unfamiliar and familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Journey of Small Courage That Colors the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Bring color back to the city:\u00a0</strong>As Luna brushes past forgotten objects, color slowly returns. Each step leaves behind a quiet ripple of change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461380/extras/steam3.gif?t=1745472676\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Collect the moon\u2019s fragments :\u00a0</strong>Solve puzzles and gather scattered pieces. The more you find, the deeper Luna\u2019s journey becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461380/extras/steam4.gif?t=1745472676\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Explore layered landscapes:\u00a0</strong>Walk through rooftops, alleys, bridges, and streams. See the city through Luna\u2019s quiet and curious eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461380/extras/steam1.gif?t=1745472676\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd0d <strong>Pass by others in silence:\u00a0\u00a0</strong>Though Luna speaks no words, moments of connection quietly unfold as she moves through the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461380/extras/steam5.gif?t=1745472676\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf15 <strong>Complete the journey:\u00a0</strong>Return the fragments to the moon, and discover how small acts of courage can bring the world back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461380/extras/steam6.gif?t=1745472676\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3461380?t=1745472676","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3461380?t=1745472676","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461380/a54130a170bc4bda5de962881ce4e57ac5d6d630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745472676","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461380/a54130a170bc4bda5de962881ce4e57ac5d6d630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745472676","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461380/extras/steam2.gif?t=1745472676\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a meteor struck the moon, Seoul fell into silence. The city lost its 